### 13. Verify seeded administrators
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/admins
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 14. Verify seeded staff
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/staff
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 15. Verify seeded time slots
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/time-slots
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
